- Medium: protocol-versioned conformance-claim schema/cases are missing from the affected-artifact inventory.
- Medium: the physical cache name conflicts with the protocol’s implementation-specific cache-layout boundary unless marked illustrative.

All pinned tests passed: protocol `30` schemas/`93` vectors, Curator `go test ./...`, and cocoaskills `488 passed, 18 skipped`. No product/spec source was modified.

